4. Reverse the patterns. Architecture, attention, FFN, normalization, quantization, tokenizer.
5. Implement. Bottom-up.
6. Verify. Forward pass. Compare against reference. Outputs match within tolerance -> correct.
7. Deliver.

**Rules:** The file is ground truth. Reproduction is the only proof. Like reading the rings of a tree to understand its history.

